    <!-- Field: /Page --></ix:exclude>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
following represents the pro forma consolidated revenue as if APT had been included in the consolidated results of the Company.
Revenue was $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionsProFormaRevenue_pn5n6_c20240101__20241231_zSgYK3wMuHMj" title="Business acquisition, pro forma revenue"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionsProFormaRevenue" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-12-31" id="Fact000791" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">29.9</ix:nonFraction></span> million</span> for the year ended December 31, 2024. The Company incurred acquisition costs of $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationAcquisitionRelatedCosts_pn5n6_c20240101__20241231_zaheRCDhOqbj" title="Business combination, incurred acquisition costs"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationAcquisitionRelatedCosts" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-12-31" id="Fact000793" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.5</ix:nonFraction></span> million
that were recognized within General and Administrative expenses for the year ended December 31, 2024.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

