income recorded for these cash and investments was $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--InterestIncomeExpenseNet_pn5n6_c20250101__20251231_zxC3dEXAU4Eh" title="Interest income"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestIncomeExpenseNet" contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact000867" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.5</ix:nonFraction></span> million and $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--InterestIncomeExpenseNet_pn5n6_c20240101__20241231_zz2ZLfatuxh1" title="Interest income"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestIncomeExpenseNet" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-12-31" id="Fact000869" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.7</ix:nonFraction></span> million during the years ended December 31, 2025, and 2024,
respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

