<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24.5pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company retired approximately $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentDisposals_pn5n6_c20250101__20251231_zI0zd61HoG8g" title="Disposals of fixed assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentDisposals" contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact000942" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.3</ix:nonFraction></span> million and less than $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentDisposals_pn5n6_c20240101__20241231__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_zNxBhmVvV6p9" title="Disposals of fixed assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentDisposals" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-12-31_srt_MaximumMember" id="Fact000944" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.1</ix:nonFraction></span> million of fully depreciated assets during the years ended December 31,
2025 and 2024, respectively. The Company had approximately $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentAdditions_pn5n6_c20250101__20251231_zS72s6TYxWok" title="Property and equipment additions"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentAdditions" contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact000946" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.1</ix:nonFraction></span> million and $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentAdditions_pn5n6_c20240101__20241231_zDGU5covmYsi" title="Property and equipment additions"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentAdditions" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-12-31" id="Fact000948" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.9</ix:nonFraction></span> million of property and equipment additions during the
years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. The additions during year ended December 31, 2025 were related to equipment purchases
and the additions during the year end December 31, 2024 were associated with the APT acquisition.</span></p>

