</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AF_zcmplx110kfd" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0.25in; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of December 31, 2025, the weighted average remaining contractual life of the options and stock appreciation rights outstanding was <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm2_dtY_c20250101__20251231__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--StockOptionsAndStockAppreciationRightsSARSMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyTwoStockIncentivePlanMember_zfgD4JKd2Wj6" title="Contractual term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_custom_StockOptionsAndStockAppreciationRightsSARSMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyTwoStockIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact001277" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm2">6.16</ix:nonNumeric></span>
years. Of the <span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingNumber_iI_pid_c20251231__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--StockOptionsAndStockAppreciationRightsSARSMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyTwoStockIncentivePlanMember_zOtd3k1DYD7" title="Number of options and stock appreciation rights outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingNumber" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_custom_StockOptionsAndStockAppreciationRightsSARSMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyTwoStockIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact001279" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">4,270,381</ix:nonFraction></span> options and stock appreciation rights that were outstanding as of December 31, 2025, <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedAndExpectedToVestExercisableNumber_iI_pid_c20251231__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--StockOptionsAndStockAppreciationRightsSARSMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyTwoStockIncentivePlanMember_zzO704yMu3Nc" title="Number of options and stock appreciation rights, exercisable, number"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedAndExpectedToVestExercisableNumber" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_custom_StockOptionsAndStockAppreciationRightsSARSMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyTwoStockIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact001281" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">3,076,786</ix:nonFraction></span> were vested and
exercisable with a weighted average exercise price of $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedAndExpectedToVestExercisableWeightedAverageExercisePrice_iI_pid_c20251231__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--StockOptionsAndStockAppreciationRightsSARSMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyTwoStockIncentivePlanMember_zc1vP0smmYql" title="Number of options and stock appreciation rights, weighted average exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedAndExpectedToVestExercisableWeightedAverageExercisePrice" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_custom_StockOptionsAndStockAppreciationRightsSARSMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyTwoStockIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact001283" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">4.01</ix:nonFraction></span> per share and a weighted average remaining term of <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedAndExpectedToVestExercisableWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm1_dtY_c20250101__20251231__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--StockOptionsAndStockAppreciationRightsSARSMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyTwoStockIncentivePlanMember_zruw1SOcdcfb" title="Number of options and stock appreciation rights remaining contractual term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_custom_StockOptionsAndStockAppreciationRightsSARSMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyTwoStockIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact001285" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedAndExpectedToVestExercisableWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm1">5.2</ix:nonNumeric></span> years.</span></p>

