<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0.25in; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">Revenues are attributed to countries based on the
location of the customer.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0.25in; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">The
Company&#8217;s long-lived assets consist primarily of property, plant, and equipment, and intangible assets. As of December 31, 2025
and 2024, no individual country other than the U.S. accounted for 10% or more of these assets.</p>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

